{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"d1811f2d7f80ccd6d8efd71df84e81582fe3d963114c5706a21ac954044ddb96","ja":"お礼のクッキー","zh":"感谢用的曲奇主文","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"b6e5dabfeaea2aaba0f762a2506565e386d3415d8b91ac5416268f2bf520026a","ja":"ほんまですか？　助かります～。\n家で用意するんは照れくさかったんで。","zh":"真的吗？太感谢了～。\n在家里准备的话总觉得有点不好意思呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"be973dde25c4c75e7b591d6d3a3d717c1205a49f56f7793e521b65440f082bb8","ja":"ほな、お仕事頑張ってください、\n●●●●プロデューサーさん。","zh":"那工作请加油哦，\n●●●●制作人。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"03c07416a2c7c18669f41d743d785167c40cb2b9cd23626e76c28bfcf75d43ad","ja":"お疲れさま！　●●●●プロデューサーがいたの？\n何、話してたんだ？","zh":"辛苦了！　刚刚是●●●●制作人在吗？\n你们在聊什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c57280fba6ffd6d5426644f3aee63da45ada28f259e5022c3ce1b586f5ea18e1","ja":"給湯室、使わせてもらえるように\nお願いしてたんや。","zh":"我去拜托了一下，\n让我们能够使用茶水间。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4c0690ab2e8c599647de648a4c220eee89fca15da6acdee9dfe92058d17ee2f4","ja":"アニキたちにクッキーでも作ってあげよ、思って。\nほら、なんやかんや世話になったから。","zh":"我想着给哥哥他们烤点饼干什么的。\n毕竟，各方面都承蒙他们照顾了嘛。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6d498f25d71585f3928056d532028ecfae67d063ccfc801bc61868be07e1509a","ja":"ああ、この前、CDを売った時のことか？　兄ちゃんが\n雪歩のファンを連れてきてびっくりしたっけ。","zh":"啊，是之前卖CD那时候的事吗？老哥把\n雪步的粉丝带过来，可把我给吓了一跳呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"967b5e01b66a729455598477a29f3e9d1814c97ea506879c86cf8ab6c16420fc","ja":"そうそう！　アニキたちも瑞希のCD買い始めて……\n思わずツッコんでしもたわ！","zh":"对对！我哥他们也开始买瑞希的CD了……\n搞得我忍不住就吐槽了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f7861972155c688dceef842ce884482076813b0fb58a611c24d0ff2e09a671a0","ja":"でも、イベントを盛り上げてもろたのは事実やし、\nお礼くらいはしとこかな～って。","zh":"不过，活动确实多亏了他们热络起来，\n我想着至少也该道声谢吧～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6962c7dd41b2c5fccb71f72e04cabaf6e0340315d42f85df6a1b8d72ecffed48","ja":"なるほどなぁ……じゃあ、オレも\n兄ちゃんたちにクッキー作ろうかな！","zh":"原来如此啊……那我也\n给哥哥们做些饼干吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"4425ab6ed4fdcf55a6afd8d829544e38803634293a55797f252b4d551ca7b434","ja":"おおっ、ええやん！\n私もひとりでやるより張り合い出そうやわ～。","zh":"哦哦，挺不错的嘛！\n感觉比起我一个人来，会更有干劲呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1594.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"34d0482330dc17f9b33f3b3854f15d34409b4aabf8dad8d7eb02c41d7c862edb","ja":"そうと決まれば、さっそく買い出しいこか♪","zh":"既然决定了，那就赶紧去采购吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
